---
import PublicLayout from "@/layouts/PublicLayout.astro";

// Terms of Use / Regulamin (legal-pages). Plain-language but complete: service
// description, acceptable use, accounts, a prominent safety disclaimer (the plan
// gives estimates, not race-day/medical/safety advice), liability limits,
// termination, and Polish/EU governing law.
const contactEmail = "hello@ultra-planner.app";
const lastUpdated = "June 19, 2026";
---

<PublicLayout title="Terms of Use — Ultra Planner">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <p class="font-mono-data text-haze/70 text-xs tracking-[0.2em]">TERMS</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight font-bold sm:text-5xl">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="font-mono-data text-haze/60 mt-3 text-xs tracking-wide">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        These terms govern your use of Ultra Planner. By using the service you agree to them. If you don't agree, please
        don't use the service.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">The service</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Ultra Planner is a pre-race planning aid for ultra runners. It estimates segment times and suggests fluid, carb,
        sodium, and gear targets from the numbers you enter. It is a planning tool — nothing more.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Your account</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        You sign in with a one-time code sent to your email — there is no password. You're responsible for keeping
        access to your email account secure. You can permanently delete your account and all its data at any time from
        <a
          class="text-trail-violet hover:text-snowcap underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors"
          href="/account/delete/confirm">Settings → Remove account</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Acceptable use</h2>
    <ul class="text-haze mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>Use the service for your own race planning, in good faith.</li>
      <li>Don't attack, overload, scrape, or attempt to break or gain unauthorized access to the service.</li>
      <li>Don't use it for anything unlawful or to harm others.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/30 bg-amber-200/10 p-6">
      <p class="font-mono-data text-xs tracking-widest text-amber-200/80">IMPORTANT — PLANNING AID ONLY</p>
      <div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-amber-100">
        <p>
          Ultra Planner gives <span class="font-semibold">estimates</span>, not instructions. Its time, fluid, carb,
          sodium, and gear figures are model-based suggestions from the data you enter — <span class="font-semibold"
            >they are not medical, nutritional, or safety advice</span
          >.
        </p>
        <p>
          Conditions, your health, and your body on the day matter more than any plan. Use your own judgement, consult
          qualified professionals where appropriate, and never rely on Ultra Planner for race-day safety decisions. You
          use the plan at your own risk.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">No warranty</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        The service is provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind. We don't guarantee that the
        estimates are accurate or that the service will be uninterrupted or error-free.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of — or
        inability to use — the service, including reliance on its estimates. Nothing in these terms limits liability
        that cannot be limited under applicable law.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Suspension and termination</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        We may suspend or restrict access to accounts that abuse the service or breach these terms. You can stop using
        the service and delete your account at any time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Governing law</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the law of Poland and applicable European Union law. Disputes are subject to the
        jurisdiction of the Polish courts, without affecting any mandatory consumer protections you have where you live.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Changes to these terms</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        We may update these terms; we'll revise the "Last updated" date above when we do. Continuing to use the service
        after a change means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display text-snowcap mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Contact</h2>
    <div class="text-haze mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Email
        <a
          class="text-trail-violet hover:text-snowcap underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors"
          href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PublicLayout>
